      <div type="clause" n="44">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 44</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXXXVIII} Gif mon þonne aceorfe an treow, þæt mæge XXX swina undergestandan, ⁊ wyrð undierne, geselle LX sciƚƚ.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, a man cuts down a tree under which thirty swine may stand and it becomes known, let him pay 60 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If, however, anyone cuts down a tree that can shelter thirty swine, and it becomes known, he shall pay 60 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon þonne aceorfe an treow, ðæt mæge XXX swina undergestondon, ⁊ wyrð undirne, gesylle LX scll'.</ab>
      </div>
